<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quiksilver cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quiksilver cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist cut its recommendation for Quiksilver Inc to hold from buy on Thursday, a spokesman for H&amp;Q said.</p>
<p>-- The downgrade was prompted by the resignation of president and chief operating officer Randall Herrel, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock was off 1-5/8 to 24-7/8 in early trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
